    "summary": "A path to buying a modest home for low-income Dane County families: Habitat builds the home and sells it to a qualified partner family with a 25-30 year, low- or no-interest mortgage, plus homebuyer education. Partner families contribute 'sweat equity' hours.",
    "benefit": "The chance to purchase a Habitat-built home with an affordable mortgage (low-to-no interest, 25-30 years), after completing homebuyer education and sweat-equity hours.",
