        "Submit an application within 6 months of the meeting.",
        "If selected, complete homebuyer education and sweat-equity hours before purchase."
      ]
    },
    "status": "waitlist",
    "seasonalNote": "Informational meetings (a prerequisite to applying) are currently full; next sessions expected in 2027.",
